GARDEN v15.9 FINAL POST-FREEZE SYNTHESIS CANDIDATE
Date: 2026-09-18
Status: REVIEW CANDIDATE — NOT YET INTEGRATED
Base: Garden v15.9 COMPLETE CROSS-REVIEWED WORKING CANDIDATE (P001-P037)
Canonical effect: NONE
Executable certification: NONE

PURPOSE
Close all recoverable post-freeze/scattered Garden upgrades and the full-history residual audit without duplicating current v15.9 owners.

A. P038 ORH/CIAH SYNTHESIS
Existing coverage dominates. Candidate additions are limited to:
A1. Saturation/overload MUST end in typed bounded dispositions; required hard rights/safety/authority/privacy/law gates cannot be silently dropped because a queue is full. Load/volume/urgency creates no new authority or priority token; AAP/current owner still selects admissible work.
A2. Downstream saturation/backpressure that affects correctness/completion MUST be explicit upstream state rather than silent work loss or unlimited queue growth.
A3. Recovery/failover revalidation explicitly includes recovered cache and in-memory state, authority/evidence/dependencies and uncertain effects before ordinary restoration.
A4. Handoff/failover is not complete merely because control switched: applicable state/effect identity, ownership/authority and acknowledgement/closure must be typed; missing acknowledgement is INCOMPLETE/UNKNOWN, not success.
A5. Uncertain/false alarm handling remains typed and effect-bounded. A monitor alarm alone creates no authority. Rights-affecting or irreversible protective action still requires the current applicable authority/safety profile.
A6. Hazard analysis includes action, suppression/no-action, fallback and shutdown consequences where materially applicable.
A7. Near-miss/precursor evidence may trigger NEEDS_REVALIDATION/research without being promoted to incident-grade truth or authority.
Duplicates: cumulative-change closure; generic end-to-end human-effect closure; generic failure-domain independence where already covered.

B. P039 UAAC/DSDIH SYNTHESIS
B1. UAAC is not a new subsystem. Current Causal Safety/Human-Effect/CTSN/CAD/OAC/security/authority owners already cover capability != ceiling, self-report != independent evidence, hidden channels/open-world uncertainty, copies/forks, authority non-accretion and cumulative effects. Add no second agency-closure owner.
B2. Where material adversarial channel/strategy coverage is unresolved, status remains scoped UNKNOWN/INCOMPLETE/non-PASS at the required assurance level; this is bounded open-world semantics, not a claim that exhaustive proof is possible.
B3. DSDIH state/effect/acknowledgement ideas are mostly already present in Process/Execution/CPI: dispatch, commit, acknowledgement, uncertain completion and reconciliation remain distinct; crash after effect before acknowledgement is OUTCOME_UNKNOWN and blind replay is forbidden.
B4. Cache/intermediary/recovery claims reuse existing Dependency/Runtime/Security/adapters/authority owners. Intermediaries cannot weaken hard gates merely because they relay/queue/cache.
No new DSDIH engine/schema family unless a later exact owner-gap is demonstrated.

C. P040 SOURCE-RIGHTS / DELTA MANAGEMENT
C1. NO NEW SEMANTIC OWNER. Current v15.9 already states public access != public domain; protected expression/code/data/figures/proprietary implementation cannot be copied without applicable permission/license; lawful public ideas/facts can inform independently drafted Garden semantics subject to applicable rights.
C2. Delta-management rules are already P036/P037 ReleaseManifest/UpgradeTraceability/CurrentReadingMap/DesignEpoch materialization practice. Keep as process lineage; do not duplicate normative design.

D. P041 MACHINE INSPECTION / PRIVACY / JUSTICE
D1. REJECT universal everyone/all-the-time private-device/message inspection authority.
D2. Machine-only processing of private content can itself be a privacy/human-effect event even when no human views the content; absence of human viewing does not erase collection/access/computation risks.
D3. Distinguish computation/access, retention, human inspection, disclosure, evidentiary use, investigative threshold, adjudicative finding and guilt/liability. None automatically implies the next.
D4. Any scoped privacy-preserving/on-device analysis requires independently valid current purpose, authority/consent/law/rights/privacy/minimization and applicable contestability/audit constraints. Technical capability/model confidence cannot create observation rights.
D5. Correlated suspicion remains epistemically distinct from probable cause or other jurisdiction-specific thresholds, admissible evidence, finding of fact and guilt; do not invent universal legal thresholds.
D6. Missing/stale/conflicting authority/purpose/jurisdiction/minimization/model-validity evidence yields non-PASS for the protected operation.

E. P042 HISTORY RECOVERY
E1. UCAS: add a bounded Contract/Agreement governance profile using existing Contract/Policy/Compliance/Authority/Law/Knowledge/Evidence/Transition owners. Preserve technical contract != actor agreement != legal enforceability; formation/context/jurisdiction; immutable term/amendment lineage; obligation→implementation→evidence trace; nonperformance != breach/liability; distinct delegation/assignment/novation; competent-authority boundary. No Contract Algebra now.
E2. Kindergarten: add child-development branch/profile semantics through existing branch/federation/human-rights/privacy/education owners. Stronger child safeguards, developmentally appropriate explanation, minimization, bounded autonomy, no manipulative engagement, child assent/contestability, guardian/authority where applicable. Competence evidence never overrides age/jurisdiction/child-rights law.
E3. FDE/CFBR: add bounded voluntary federation/branch reconciliation profile through existing federation/MAC/branch/authority/security/DesignEpoch owners. Reachability != permission, signed/verifiable releases, opt-in/revocable mirroring, no security bypass, no popularity sovereignty, no creator override, pull-and-verify upgrades, explicit partition/divergence/rejoin reconciliation, semantic convergence != implementation monoculture.
E4. HumanSystemsMap: add a purpose-limited GSL-KR/WorldEvidence profile if current owners lack an equivalent: formal rules vs observed practice remain distinct, claims bind provenance/jurisdiction/time/uncertainty, contradictions stay explicit, private systems require authority/privacy, knowledge creates no action authority.
E5. TopicCompletenessProfile: add a Research/KR/Audit coverage profile if not duplicate: declared dimensions, scoped coverage, NO_KNOWN_GAP_WITHIN_DECLARED_SCOPE rather than omniscience, explicit missing/unknown/stale coverage, gap→research candidate only.
E6. Manufacturing qualification-transfer: specialize existing transfer/Dependency/DesignEpoch qualification owners. Per-claim applicability, source/target roots, invalidators, partial evidence reuse, required retest/reinspection plan; similarity/certification never automatically transfers external certification.
E7. GAC/GTAH/KR-CEA/DerivedView/Legal-SMT historical ideas are SUBSUMED or already present; do not add duplicate owners.
E8. CASI adapter activation remains DEFERRED because exact operational qualification interface is still insufficiently recovered.

HARD INVARIANTS FOR FINAL REVIEW
1. No review consensus creates authority, truth, canon, certification or deployment permission.
2. No new SchemaID is minted merely from a convenient candidate name.
3. Existing owner beats duplicate subsystem.
4. UNKNOWN/STALE/CONFLICT/INCOMPLETE/BLOCKED are non-PASS where hard resolution is required.
5. Rights, privacy, consent/assent, legitimate authority, safety, law, appeal/contestability and human agency survive federation, recovery, optimization and profile specialization.
6. Child-development specialization can strengthen safeguards but cannot waive protected rights.
7. Federation connectivity/adoption/popularity cannot create constitutional supremacy.
8. Contract text/signature cannot manufacture authority or legal enforceability.
9. Coverage profiles never claim closed-world omniscience.
10. Qualification transfer never claims certification merely from similarity.
11. Post-review material semantic edits reopen review/materialization closure.

FINAL REVIEW REQUEST
Try to falsify this synthesis. For every E1-E6 and A1-A7/D1-D6:
- identify duplicate/current-owner coverage;
- identify missing hard constraint/counterexample;
- recommend KEEP / PATCH / REMOVE / DEFER;
- require the smallest surviving delta.
